{% doc %}
  Floating call button, stacked directly above the WhatsApp chat button.

  Renders nothing unless it is switched on and a number is available, so the store
  never ships a button that dials nowhere.

  Two modes, set in Theme settings:

  - Phone call (default) -> tel: link. Works on every device, today.
  - WhatsApp call        -> wa.me/call/<number>. This is a real, documented Meta
                            deep link, but it only works for a number on the
                            WhatsApp Business PLATFORM (Cloud API) with calling
                            adopted. On a free WhatsApp Business app number -- what
                            this shop uses -- it does nothing. It is offered so the
                            switch is one setting on the day that changes, not a
                            rebuild.

  Gold rather than WhatsApp green on purpose: two green circles stacked would leave
  the customer guessing which one calls and which one chats.

  @example
  {% render 'call-button' %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- capture call_number -%}
  {%- render 'whatsapp-number', number: settings.call_number -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- liquid
  assign call_number = call_number | strip
  if settings.call_enabled != true or call_number == blank
    break
  endif

  if settings.call_mode == 'whatsapp'
    assign call_href = 'https://wa.me/call/' | append: call_number
    assign call_aria = 'content.call_whatsapp_aria' | t | default: 'Call us on WhatsApp'
  else
    assign call_href = 'tel:+' | append: call_number
    assign call_aria = 'content.call_aria' | t | default: 'Call us'
  endif
-%}

<a
  class="call-float"
  href="{{ call_href }}"
  aria-label="{{ call_aria }}"
>
  {%- comment -%}
    No phone glyph ships with the theme -- snippets/icon.liquid has no 'phone' case
    and there is no icon-phone.svg -- so it is inline here.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <svg
    class="call-float__icon"
    aria-hidden="true"
    focusable="false"
    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
    width="26"
    height="26"
    fill="none"
    stroke="currentColor"
    stroke-width="1.8"
    stroke-linecap="round"
    stroke-linejoin="round"
  >
    <path
      d="M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2a1 1 0 0 1 1-.24 11.4 11.4 0 0 0 3.6.58 1 1 0 0 1 1 1V20a1 1 0 0 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3.5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1 11.4 11.4 0 0 0 .58 3.6 1 1 0 0 1-.25 1z"
    ></path>
  </svg>
</a>
